ANCELLED and ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT error codes\n              OrderControllerTest.kt — added 4 tests for cancel scenarios and idempotence\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt — added test for shipment rejection on cancelled order\n\nTests         Cancel active order: verifies CANCELLED status, returns 200, cascades to CREATED shipments\n              Idempotent cancel: verifies retry succeeds and changes nothing\n              Confirmed shipment blocks cancel: verifies 409, order stays ACTIVE, shipment stays CONFIRMED\n              Cancel non-existent order: verifies 404 with ORDER_NOT_FOUND code\n              Shipment on cancelled order: verifies 409 with ORDER_CANCELLED code\n\nVerification  ./mvnw clean test: BUILD SUCCESS, all 18 tests passed (8 in OrderControllerTest, 6 in ShipmentControllerTest, 1 in SampleServiceApplicationTests, 3 in CustomerControllerTest)\n\nNot done      None — all acceptance criteria met, all tests passing, no dependencies added, no files outside scope modified\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":919,"cache_read_input_tokens":36751,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":919},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c2e827d-a35c-4112-a984-0c8b9d98707e","uuid":"09a4e245-6c47-4b11-81f4-11f688356a77","timestamp":"2026-09-16T07:15:20.256Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6hvpxocb4CXLzETYvX5"}
